{"format":"lognara-metrics","version":1,"metrics":[{"name":"client_cache_hits","title":"Попаданий в кеш клиента","description":"Отдача релиза из локального кеша.","unit":"запросов","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"contains":"(\"client_cache_hits\": ","pattern":"\\(\"client_cache_hits\": (?P<value>-?\\d+)\\)","value_group":"value"}},{"name":"client_releases_downloaded","title":"Отданных релизов","description":"Ответ 200 на скачивание релиза.","unit":"релизов","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"contains":"(\"client_releases_downloaded\": ","pattern":"\\(\"client_releases_downloaded\": (?P<value>-?\\d+)\\)","value_group":"value"}},{"name":"client_storage_download_bytes","title":"Прокинутых байт скачивания","description":"Объём отданного контента.","unit":"байт","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"contains":"(\"client_storage_download_bytes\": ","pattern":"\\(\"client_storage_download_bytes\": (?P<value>-?\\d+)\\)","value_group":"value"}},{"name":"client_cache_misses","title":"Промахов кеша клиента","description":"Релиза нет в кеше, требуется проксирование.","unit":"запросов","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"contains":"(\"client_cache_misses\": ","pattern":"\\(\"client_cache_misses\": (?P<value>-?\\d+)\\)","value_group":"value"}},{"name":"client_storage_errors","title":"Ошибок хранилища клиента","description":"Ошибки прокси/загрузки/валидации.","unit":"ошибок","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"contains":"(\"client_storage_errors\": ","pattern":"\\(\"client_storage_errors\": (?P<value>-?\\d+)\\)","value_group":"value"}},{"name":"client_releases_uploaded","title":"Принятых новых релизов","description":"Загрузка релиза в хранилище.","unit":"релизов","kind":"delta","aggregation":"sum","enabled":true,"rule":{"contains":"(\"client_releases_uploaded\": ","pattern":"\\(\"client_releases_uploaded\": (?P<value>-?\\d+)\\)","value_group":"value"}},{"name":"cli